<h2 id="who-we-are">Who we are</h2>
<p>Your information is being collected by <strong>Government Technology Platforms</strong>, Digital NSW, part of the NSW Department of Customer Service.</p>

<h2 id="why-we-collect-your-information">Why we collect your information</h2>
<p>We collect personal information for the purposes of:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Sending updates on the latest DDS components and best practices</li>
  <li>Providing access to DDS resources, including Figma libraries</li>
  <li>Improving and support service planning, product improvements, and future development.</li>
</ul>
<p>These updates are offered as an ‘opt in’ subscription. You can 'opt out' at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link at the bottom of the newsletter or contacting <a href="mailto:designsystem@customerservice.nsw.gov.au">designsystem@customerservice.nsw.gov.au</a> directly.</p>

<h2 id="the-kinds-of-information-we-collect">The kinds of information we collect</h2>
<p>We may collect the following information:</p>
<ul>
  <li>First and last name</li>
  <li>Your role</li>
  <li>NSW Government email address</li>
  <li>Which team and agency you work for</li>
  <li>Government portfolio</li>
  <li>Your topics of interest</li>
  <li>Type of access for Figma and reason</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="how-we-collect-information">How we collect information</h2>
<p>We collect your information directly from you through online registration forms.</p>

<h2 id="how-we-use-information">How we use information</h2>
<p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Manage DDS mailing lists and subscriber information,</li>
  <li>Provide access to DDS resources, including Figma libraries,</li>
  <li>Support DDS service planning, product improvements, and future development.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="who-we-share-information-with">Who we share information with</h2>
<p>We may share your information with our third-party mailing service provider to distribute and manage email notifications.</p>
<p>We will not disclose your information to anybody else, except for when you have given your consent</p>

<h2 id="how-long-we-keep-information-for">How long we keep information for</h2>
<p>We will only keep information for as long as we need it to fulfil the purposes we collected it for.</p>
<p>Our third-party mailing service provider will store your personal information for as long as you subscribe to these notifications. If you unsubscribe, your information will be deleted from their systems and servers.</p>

<h2 id="how-we-keep-information-secure">How we keep information secure</h2>
<p>We maintain a <a href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/departments-and-agencies/customer-service/privacy-and-personal-information/privacy-management-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Management Plan<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new window)</span></a>, which outlines how we comply with NSW privacy laws, and the measures we have in place to help protect personal information from loss, unauthorised access, use, modification, disclosure, or other misuse.</p>

<h2 id="your-rights">Your rights</h2>
<p>Subject to certain conditions, you have the following rights in relation to your personal information:</p>
<ul>
  <li>The right to request access to your personal information</li>
  <li>The right to request correction of your personal information.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you wish to invoke any of the above rights, please contact us using the details below.</p>

<h2 id="contact-us">Contact us</h2>
<p>Please visit <a href="https://www.digital.nsw.gov.au/delivery/government-technology-platforms/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digital NSW Government Technology Platforms Privacy<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new window)</span></a> for more information on our privacy practices.</p>
